rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"412"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T07:02:56-08:00","id":78289,"title":"","content":"A couple of novel series that Ive found to have a very Exalted feel are:<br /> <br /> 1) The Deathstalker series by Simon R Green. Very much Heavens Reach, Exalted in space.<br /> 2) The Stormlight archive series by Brandon Sanderson. The second book is due out next month and the series has a very cool setting with civilisation fallen from the First Age equivelant and some characters who are pretty much Exalts coming into their powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/624-bejazeus","name":"Bejazeus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T07:33:12-08:00","id":78293,"title":"","content":"The 2011 Thundercats reboot. No, seriously.<br /> <br /> It opens in a fantasy-style Empire with a Europe-meets-Egypt kind of flare. The empire is wildly racist, uses slavery and torture, and ostracizes the king's son for doing things like caring about the underclass and believing in ancient legends of &quot;technology&quot;. Still, as the heir, he is trained in using the awesomely powerful magical sword which maintained the Empire's strength for generations.<br /> <br /> And then the Empire is brought down by a surprise attack from its nomadic tribal longtime enemies... armed with advanced technology, and ultimately revealed to be working for an ancient undead evil who once ruled all the races of this region, and much more besides. Only a handful of people escape to fight a guerilla war, but they have to invest their resources in trying to gain more followers, and cause their foes to defect when possible, if they want to win in the long term... in the short term, on the other hand, they are racing to reach magical sanctums to gain the powerful stones found there.<br /> <br /> It seems pretty applicable to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T08:05:29-08:00","id":78312,"title":"","content":"Shinobi ( <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0475723/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0475723/?ref_=nv_sr_1</a> ). Because of all the cool, distinct and heavily themed martial arts.<br /> <br /> Ninja Scroll ( <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0107692/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0107692/?ref_=nv_sr_1</a> ). An obvious one, I know, but no one has mentioned it yet.<br /> <br /> True Legend ( <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt1425257/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.imdb.com/title/tt1425257/?ref_=nv_sr_1</a> ). Almost forgot about this one. It has all the ingredients of Exalted awesomeness. Supernatural martial arts,epic storytelling and a Sidereal riding on the head of a god.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2355,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2355-ratatosk","user":"Ratatosk","date":". 02-24-2014, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2355-ratatosk","name":"Ratatosk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2355_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T09:30:04-08:00","id":81089,"title":"","content":"A TCD of Oramus fighting a Solar ?<br /> <br /> Man, I wish I have the ability to wack people I don't like with a Stop sign too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jwTa3BrXh9w\" data-code=\"jwTa3BrXh9w\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jwTa3BrXh9w/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T09:43:06-08:00","id":81092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bejazeus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=78289#post78289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Stormlight archive series by Brandon Sanderson. The second book is due out next month and the series has a very cool setting with civilisation fallen from the First Age equivelant and some characters who are pretty much Exalts coming into their powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sanderson's novel Warbreaker also has a very Exalted feel to it, with people being endowed with godlike power and having to sort out the moral implications themselves, while his Mistborn Trilogy deals with using supernatural means to fight an entrenched and <i>very</i> horrifying empire (I view it as ideal Deathlord inspiration) which is just too massive to attack head-on no matter how great your power, while also trying to piece together the mysteries of the past to understand how this happened.<br /> <br /> I would, honestly, recommend either of those over the Stormlight Archive, since they are a standalone novel and a trilogy, respectively, and not the first two thousand-page-long entries in a series expected to span ten books coming out over the next thirteen years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T10:07:38-08:00","id":81101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=81089#post81089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A TCD of Oramus fighting a Solar ?<br /> <br /> Man, I wish I have the ability to wack people I don't like with a Stop sign too,</div> </div> </div> </div>You can do that as an Air Aspect...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-gXlTqXwWopI/UhVZC9PhfKI/AAAAAAAAATs/gqHYckUWen4/w289-h149-no/1353194266009.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> *EDIT*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=73227#post73227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always want a 3D version of Perfect Cherry Blossom and now my wish has been granted~</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that was probably the coolest Youtube video I've seen this year. Think I will watch the other ones he's made. <br /> <br /> The problem with Tohou is that I have no clue how I would go about describing that stuff without coming off as kind of a tool.<br /> <br /> &quot;There's a Class 10 Hurricane coming at you. And all the rain is made out of butterflies, flower petals and DEATH. If even a drop of that touches you, you die. And that thing is flying at you in all it's rainbow colored glory.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright, you dodge the wave of butterflies. Now there's a wave of giant fucking blue spheres each one twice the size of your body. There's like, I dunno. a hundred of them. They're not as fast, but they're still hard to dodge.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now the enemy starts shooting laser beams, giant pink laser... what? Hey, where are you going? Don't tell me that's bullshit. Get back here and dodge those laser beams of death.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 02-27-2014, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T10:19:51-08:00","id":81108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=81092#post81092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sanderson's novel Warbreaker also has a very Exalted feel to it, with people being endowed with godlike power and having to sort out the moral implications themselves...</div> </div> </div> </div>The godlike power of the Returned isn't actually all <i>that</i> godlike (unless you're the God-King), not Exalted-level certainly, but it does explore a society with people who have what is considered divine authority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T16:20:07-08:00","id":81301,"title":"","content":"When I saw this thread title, for a moment I thought it was about media that had become Exalted - i.e., they started out mortal-grade then got a lot better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/240-winged-cat","name":"Winged Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar240_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T18:49:08-08:00","id":81358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=81101#post81101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, that was probably the coolest Youtube video I've seen this year. Think I will watch the other ones he's made.<br /> <br /> The problem with Tohou is that I have no clue how I would go about describing that stuff without coming off as kind of a tool.<br /> <br /> &quot;There's a Class 10 Hurricane coming at you. And all the rain is made out of butterflies, flower petals and DEATH. If even a drop of that touches you, you die. And that thing is flying at you in all it's rainbow colored glory.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright, you dodge the wave of butterflies. Now there's a wave of giant fucking blue spheres each one twice the size of your body. There's like, I dunno. a hundred of them. They're not as fast, but they're still hard to dodge.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now the enemy starts shooting laser beams, giant pink laser... what? Hey, where are you going? Don't tell me that's bullshit. Get back here and dodge those laser beams of death.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You could just make the danmaku charm fluff something like Self as Cyclone Stance or Thousand Wounds Feinting, you can unleash a shit load of projects as stunning but mechanically your flurry still have a finity number of attack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T18:53:57-08:00","id":81360,"title":"","content":"And, hey, if you're playing 2E, taking 2-8 insta kill attacks per turn is the standard order of business, anyway. Bring in something like Lightspeed Body Dynamics, and you've even already got rules for Grazing.<br /> <br /> The aesthetics of the thing are a lot more laserey than I like my Exalted, but there's lots of people who roll that way. And an endless pattern of powerful, shifting spheres sure seems like a thing that SOME Exalted antagonists might use. Perhaps ones who reside within their own cognomen, or servitors of same.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T11:02:47-08:00","id":81670,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sbzUfV3_JIA\" target=\"_blank\">Here's how most mixed games will play out.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T12:08:38-08:00","id":81716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryumaru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=68826#post68826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have extolled the virtues (or would that be Virtues?) of a particular series repeatedly in a chat I'm a part of, mostly because it friggin' deserves it. My metaphorical throat is hoarse from shouting about how good this series is for Exalted inspiration, so I'm just going to tell everyone here: Go to Crunchryoll right now, and search for &quot;Magi: Labyrinth of Magic&quot;. <i><b>TELL ME THIS ISN'T FRIGGIN' EXALTED I DARE YOU</b></i></div> </div> </div> </div> That is absolutely what I want when I build a manse<br /> <br /> for those that haven't seen it here is a clip<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTit5k75uvE\" data-code=\"xTit5k75uvE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xTit5k75uvE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":359,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","user":"Dezeroth","date":". 02-28-2014, 09:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T19:01:30-08:00","id":81871,"title":"","content":"this makes me think of massive wars in exalted with lots of artifacts<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=He0NCeSxnAU\" data-code=\"He0NCeSxnAU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/He0NCeSxnAU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":359,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","user":"Dezeroth","date":". 02-28-2014, 10:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T05:24:00-08:00","id":83099,"title":"","content":"Abyssal (a Jiang-Shi AKA Chinese Zombie) vs Abyssal (a Half-Ghosted Gardener)<br /> <br /> I love how the Jiang-Shi movement is both fluid and stiff at the same time. Hmmmm, never realized those &quot;Allow you to deal and parry Lethal damage with your bare-hands&quot; power in most MA Form look so awesome in motion.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.minus.com/ibgPQFLbQpULXH.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T05:29:06-08:00","id":83101,"title":"","content":"The Fate series is very good for getting an image of Exalted combat, especially when it comes to artifacts and Evocations. Here's Solar Archery and 