ission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T10:36:03-07:00","id":109425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=108001#post108001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although he's not a direct influence on Exalted, no thread of this sort should go by without...<a href=\"http://www.pigdogproductions.com/jack%20kirby.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b>The King!!</b></a></div> </div> </div> </div>Every energy effect in my version of Creation includes Kirby Dots. =3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-09T23:35:09-07:00","id":109890,"title":"","content":"One of the first things that springs to mind for me is Negima - not so much to begin with, but by the time of the magical world arc it's become a fantasy kitchen sink with ridiculously overpowered characters. (haven't watched the anime, so not sure how that goes)<br /> <br /> The first few minutes (intro) of the first ep of Samurai Girls also inspired me to try to run a modern exalted game.<br /> <br /> And, on the note of modern exalted, Day Watch has some awesome examples of drive charms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2688-nomel","name":"nomel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-10T00:00:38-07:00","id":109909,"title":"","content":"I hate to follow up the last webcomic, but <a href=\"http://www.nuklearpower.com/2009/08/04/how-i-killed-your-master-001\" target=\"_blank\">How I Killed Your Master</a> is an awesome Wuxia story (even tho it seems to be on hiatus, sadly)! Hell, it even features a MA style called &quot;The Divine Fist of the Unconquerable Sky&quot;! Also, Mantis vs. Tiger:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.nuklearpower.com/2010/03/12/how-i-killed-your-master-046/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.nuklearpower.com/2010/03/12/how-i-killed-your-master-046/\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>http://www.nuklearpower.com/2010/03/12/how-i-killed-your-master-046/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cu