mbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/834-hk-87","name":"HK-87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T01:44:16-07:00","id":111952,"title":"","content":"Two Modern Exalted<br /> <br /> A rogue Air Aspect facing two agents of the All-Seeing Eye:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DaPJuteodfs\" data-code=\"DaPJuteodfs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DaPJuteodfs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Not sure how to describe this one, but that's definitely some Sidereal nonsense going on:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fvcrIQmhZj4\" data-code=\"fvcrIQmhZj4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/fvcrIQmhZj4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> EDIT: Just leaving this one as a hyperlink since some of the backstory here is explained in the video description, it's a prologue for the same series as that second video and explains a bit of the character's background. I haven't been following the Kickstarter they ran for the show, but I wasn't expecting the Eagle Clan's skills to go quite that far: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BuTLWh-0ce0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BuTLWh-0ce0</a><br /> <br /> EDIT2: Actually - Clandestine as a whole looks very Exalted-esque, so here're the other previews on the channel:<br /> Lion Clan<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pae0T1dNuOA\" data-code=\"pae0T1dNuOA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pae0T1dNuOA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Wolf Clan<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eBlviMous5s\" data-code=\"eBlviMous5s\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eBlviMous5s/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Trailer<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kgtgwrPO868\" data-code=\"kgtgwrPO868\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/kgtgwrPO868/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1774,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1774-shadowfighter88","user":"ShadowFighter88","date":". 04-13-2014, 05:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1774-shadowfighter88","name":"ShadowFighter88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T12:01:45-07:00","id":112831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=109909#post109909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hate to follow up the last webcomic, but <a href=\"http://www.nuklearpower.com/2009/08/04/how-i-killed-your-master-001\" target=\"_blank\">How I Killed Your Master</a> is an awesome Wuxia story (even tho it seems to be on hiatus, sadly)!</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, I don't think that story is going to be finished, as it has been on hiatus since February 2011<br /> <br /> Now, for something else: I'm pretty sure one could make an Exaltation story out of the <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=prim-leaves-her-fathers-house\" target=\"_blank\">most recent Kill Six Billion Demons</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T19:30:35-07:00","id":113066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=83099#post83099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Abyssal (a Jiang-Shi AKA Chinese Zombie) vs Abyssal (a Half-Ghosted Gardener)<br /> <br /> I love how the Jiang-Shi movement is both fluid and stiff at the same time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine being able to fly helps one circumvent the inability to bend at the knees and elbows.<br /> <br /> However, a Jiang-Shi doesn't need to be an Abyssal. Usually, it would more properly a Liminal, or a regular zombie. In this case, the zombie might be animated by its own ghost, forced to possess the body by the necromancer, Seiga.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hmmmm, never realized those &quot;Allow you to deal and parry Lethal damage with your bare-hands&quot; power in most MA Form look so awesome in motion. </div> </div> </div>It is indeed an amazing gif.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T01:34:01-07:00","id":113201,"title":"","content":"Imagine a dance-focused Infernal facing off against this Sworn Brotherhood of Air Aspects:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3MteSlpxCpo\" data-code=\"3MteSlpxCpo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/3MteSlpxCpo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":864,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","user":"Jutlander","date":". 04-15-2014, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T19:33:32-07:00","id":115075,"title":"","content":"This is rather how I like to envision the Underworld. <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A76a_LNIYwE\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A76a_LNIYwE</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T02:30:35-07:00","id":115180,"title":"","content":"I've been rereading some Discworld, and do you know who I'm finding to be a great inspiration for Sidereals? Not the archetype ones, all-knowing, that never actually <b>EXIST</b> anywhere except internet forum discussions, but the <i>real </i>way Sidereals generally end up being played in a game?<br /> <br /> Moist von Lipwig.<br /> <br /> Always living a foot away from the line of total disaster, surrounded by people who know things he doesn't and needing to stay one step ahead of them and get their knowledge out of them without giving up his own, interacting with everyone through aliases and false personalities and masks and actor roles and always a hair's breadth from the house of cards falling on his head, corkscrewing every tool available towards a mandated end he has little control over, never ever getting what he needs and having to improvise with the crazies he has, influencing people by way of making circumstances so they WANT to be influenced and filling in the &quot;silhouettes&quot; in people's heads by playing the archetypes they believe already...<br /> <br /> Moist is <i>textbook </i>Sid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1793,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1793-drascin","user":"Drascin","date":". 04-18-2014, 05:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1793-drascin","name":"Drascin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"400"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T04:40:12-07:00","id":115208,"title":"","content":"The second manga series (manga, <i>not</i> anime) of Rosario Vampire. No, really. It takes a while for the action to begin, but by the third volume or so you've got a plethora of beautifully drawn fight scenes between various humanoid monsters, all of which slot very easily into Exalted roles- the Akashiya family of vampires, in particular, are exemplars of Abyssal conduct. And the scene where Kurumu cures ghoulification through the Power Of Love (tm) perfectly illustrates how a Chosen of Serenity would Exalt.<br /> On the musical side of things, &quot;Kings and Queens&quot; and &quot;This Is War&quot; (by 30 Seconds to Mars) always get me in a suitably epic mood.<br /> Mirror's Edge and Dishonoured are games for the Night Caste in all of us.<br /> The comic Digger provides excellent inspiration for how the Immaculate Order interacts with spirits and demons.<br /> Also, has anyone here read this blog? <a href=\"http://tentacledvitriol.wordpress.com/category/exalted-movie-Mondays/\" target=\"_blank\">http://tentacledvitriol.wordpress.co...movie-Mondays/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T10:23:34-07:00","id":115359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanandithras</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=101127#post101127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate Matrix <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bzte-Fxz8I8\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bzte-Fxz8I8</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I have seen the face of the modern blue sid, and it was glorious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/999-winterstar","name":"Winterstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar999_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T10:26:57-07:00","id":115360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Winterstar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=115359#post115359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have seen the face of the modern blue sid, and it was glorious.</div> </div> </div> </div>With a video like that I could almost be convinced to play a Sid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/834-hk-87","name":"HK-87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T11:32:53-07:00","id":115416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drascin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=115180#post115180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been rereading some Discworld, and do you know who I'm finding to be a great inspiration for Sidereals? Not the archetype ones, all-knowing, that never actually <b>EXIST</b> anywhere except internet forum discussions, but the <i>real </i>way Sidereals generally end up being played in a game?<br /> <br /> Moist von Lipwig.<br /> <br /> Always living a foot away from the line of total disaster, surrounded by people who know things he doesn't and needing to stay one step ahead of them and get their knowledge out of them without giving up his own, interacting with everyone through aliases and false personalities and masks and actor roles and always a hair's breadth from the house of cards falling on his head, corkscrewing every tool available towards a mandated end he has little control over, never ever getting what he needs and having to improvise with the crazies he has, influencing people by way of making circumstances so they WANT to be influenced and filling in the &quot;silhouettes&quot; in people's heads by playing the archetypes they believe already...<br /> <br /> Moist is <i>textbook </i>Sid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy crap, I'd never thought if it that way, by now that you've mentioned it I couldn't agree more. By being the most average looking person in the world, he even tends to fade from people's memories on his own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T12:03:16-07:00","id":115444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Winterstar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=115359#post115359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I have seen the face of the modern blue sid, and it was glorious.</div> </div> </div> </div> The fact that it included a &quot;sidereal in a teacup&quot; scene was just too good to pass up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T13:12:20-07:00","id":115489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanandithras</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=115444#post115444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The fact that it included a &quot;sidereal in a teacup&quot; scene was just too good to pass up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm seriously going to show that video to my gaming group. It captures the essence of the job so perfectly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/999-winterstar","name":"Winterstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar999_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T00:54:05-07:00","id":116856,"title":"","content":"From the <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-45\" target=\"_blank\">most recent Kill Six Billion Demons</a>, tell me if this isn't something some First Age Solar hedonist would do:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There was once a king named UN-Payam who sat at the right hand of YISUN\u2019s throne and ruled a palace of burnished gold and fire and dispensed justice in all things. It was let known once that Payam had grown an extraordinary plum \u2013 enormous in size, with adamant skin that was burnished as a breastplate and fifty times as hardy. Payam was desirous of a pillow friend of fiery heart and excellent skill with their mouth and let know that whosoever could break the skin of that plum with their teeth he would swear to share his bed with for three nights in whatever disposition they may desire. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T12:42:05-07:00","id":117103,"title":"","content":"Having finally gotten my hands on and watched a copy of 2014's The Monkey King, I cannot recommend it enough for Exalted inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T14:42:07-07:00","id":117178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=117103#post117103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having finally gotten my hands on and watched a copy of 2014's The Monkey King, I cannot recommend it enough for Exalted inspiration.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have seen it recently as well and fully support the recommendation. I know I really want a pair of swords with Evocations that manifest energy dragons or manifest a single giant dragon...<br /> One alert, though: that movie can be confusing, or at least seem to introduce random characters out of nowhere without explaining anything. It is very likely to be a better experience if you are familiar with the first part of the Journey to the West book. Though they deviate from it quite a bit from what I recall, you should at least help recognize gods, demons, dragon kings and weird situations.<br /> <br /> Also, I have <i>just </i>finished watching &quot;Young Detective Dee: Rise of the Sea Dragon&quot; and it is very good as well for Exalted inspiration, much like &quot;Detective Dee and the Mystery of the Phantom Flame&quot; and...well, just about all of Tsui Hark's movies","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T15:10:05-07:00","id":117189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=117178#post117178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have seen it recently as well and fully support the recommendation. I know I really want a pair of swords with Evocations that manifest energy dragons or manifest a single giant dragon...<br /> One alert, though: that movie can be confusing, or at least seem to introduce random characters out of nowhere without explaining anything. It is very likely to be a better experience if you are familiar with the first part of the Journey to the West book. Though they deviate from it quite a bit from what I recall, you should at least help recognize gods, demons, dragon kings and weird situations.<br /> <br /> Also, I have <i>just </i>finished watching &quot;Young Detective Dee: Rise of the Sea Dragon&quot; and it is very good as well for Exalted inspiration, much like &quot;Detective Dee and the Mystery of the Phantom Flame&quot; and...well, just about all of Tsui Hark's movies</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't help that, it being an official Chinese government movie, they somehow managed to secularize a Buddhist propaganda piece. Also, most chill Jade Emperor in the history of ever.<br /> <br /> Can definitely get behind the &quot;Both Detective Dee movies, as well as anything Tsui Hark&quot;, Flying Swords of Dragon Gate is a particularly good one for Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T15:53:09-07:00","id":117213,"title":"","content":"Oh, also, I believe I've mentioned it in other threads, but not here.<br /> <br /> <i>Seirei no Moribito</i> is a wonderful example of how Heroic Mortals work, all around - Balsa is my go-to example of what a Heroic Mortal looks like. Pretty much the only Exalt in the entire thing is probably Torogai, but still it probably fits Exalted better than a great many supposedly fitting inspirations. And pretty much any ST can learn of how the author builds the cultures and myths. She's an anthropologist and it rather shows.<br /> <br /> That said, it tends to approach moral quandaries from the opposite direction Exalted, being a White Wolf game, usually does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1793-drascin","name":"Drascin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"400"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T01:59:21-07:00","id":118332,"title":"","content":"Oh man,<br /> Anyone saw the most recent episode of Adventure Time? (&quot;Escape from the Citadel&quot;, I think it was called).<br /> If the confrontation between The Lich and Finn isn't a great depiction of a Deathlord, then I do not know what is.<br /> (Also, great example of Evocations near the end, but I've always felt the Blade of Grass was a great inspiration for Evocations)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1920-kim","name":"Kim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T08:49:47-07:00","id":118448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=118332#post118332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh man, Anyone saw the most recent episode of Adventure Time? (&amp;quot;Escape from the Citadel&amp;quot;, I think it was called). If the confrontation between The Lich and Finn isn't a great depiction of a Deathlord, then I do not know what is. (Also, great example of Evocations near the end, but I've always felt the Blade of Grass was a great inspiration for Evocations)</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm kind of hoping the new flower sprout eventually grows into a planty replacement arm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T07:30:06-07:00","id":119731,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HdJFGupXYIo\" target=\"_blank\">Love and Martial Arts amongst the Exalted of the Modern Age!</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T08:53:34-07:00","id":119767,"title":"","content":"The Homura vs Mami fight in Puella Magi Madoka Magica is so good that I want to guns in Creation :&lt;<br /> <br /> The way they use their firearms is a very &quot;no-nonsene/straight-foward&quot; kind of way so you can say that they are both Solar, but they can be Sidereal too with Homura's ability to stop time (a SMA, maybe Monochrome Calendar of Despair ?) and Mami's habit of using ribbons to &quot;connect/bind&quot; thing (It's Sidereal's Linguistic right there !)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVi_fs2oz3E\" data-code=\"tVi_fs2oz3E\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tVi_fs2oz3E/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]