she moving during the earlier time-stop without being connected to Homura?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mami is OP seem like a reasonable explanation, I mean, she still pwn poor Homu even after she got Time-Stop !<br /> <br /> Edit: I just watched the scene again, seem like Homura has already got stuck with the ribbon when the fight started, I don't know why the animator didn't draw it in the battle scene though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-27-2014, 11:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T07:28:25-07:00","id":120321,"title":"","content":"Not necessarily Exalted Media, though the anime this is from could probably give some kind of inspiration. This will be my reaction when I finally have the rules in my hands.<br /> <br /> Make sure to watch it at least for thirty seconds.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6EfhAFA2yFE\" data-code=\"6EfhAFA2yFE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6EfhAFA2yFE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://s67.photobucket.com/user/EggmanSizzle/media/Ex3KSBadge_zps950331e7.gif.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i67.photobucket.com/albums/h311/EggmanSizzle/Ex3KSBadge_zps950331e7.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"http://s67.photobucket.com/user/EggmanSizzle/media/BackerBadgesmall_zps424a0237.png.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i67.photobucket.com/albums/h311/EggmanSizzle/BackerBadgesmall_zps424a0237.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":846,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/846-eggmansizzle","user":"eggmansizzle","date":". 04-27-2014, 10:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/846-eggmansizzle","name":"eggmansizzle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar846_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T08:06:02-07:00","id":120342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=120153#post120153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A firewand shoot out a giant ball of flame, need to be recharge after everyshot and I'm one hundred percent sure that everyone who like their Firearms in Creation want to create bullet-storm like this:</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much this. It's not nearly as easy to stunt a fireball as it is to stunt trick shots and ricochets bouncing off of anything and everything in the environment. Let's see a firewand-user parry attacks by shooting them out of the air (and on those rare occasions that he can, he always has to stop and reload).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":834,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/834-hk-87","user":"HK-87","date":". 04-27-2014, 11:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/834-hk-87","name":"HK-87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T17:01:45-07:00","id":120616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drascin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=117213#post117213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Seirei no Moribito</i> is a wonderful example of how Heroic Mortals work, all around - Balsa is my go-to example of what a Heroic Mortal looks like. .</div> </div> </div> </div>Given some of the things she days I thought of her as a terrestrial exalt... Excellent source material none the less<br /> <br /> Kagan McLeod's <i>Infinite Kung Fu</i><br /> <br /> <i>Six Gun Tarot R. S. Belcher</i> is a Steampunk/Urban Fantasy/Pulp Cthulhu, but it has a some excellent set pieces for a game set in Gem.<br /> <br /> <i>Under Heaven </i>and <i>River of Stars</i> by guy gavriel kay are both excellent fictional depictions of Tang and Song Era China with plenty of corruption and intrigue.<br /> <br /> <i>Malaria</i> -- <a href=\"http://www.theanimationblog.com/?s=malaria\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.theanimationblog.com/?s=malaria</a> is also a Fantasy Western, but is an excellent example of what the Solar With No Name would be if he turned out to be the Abysal With no Name.<br /> <br /> T<i>he Reward</i> -- <a href=\"http://www.theanimationblog.com/2013/01/26/short-film-spotlight-the-reward/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.theanimationblog.com/2013...ht-the-reward/</a> stay through the credits <br /> <br /> The anime <i>Vision of Escaflowne</i> is an older one, but has the epic sweep of story, warstriders, a badass who fights warstriders on foot, swordfights, and a villain who hijacks the loom of fate for his own ends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T08:55:54-07:00","id":120960,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MVt32qoyhi0\" target=\"_blank\">Wow...Pretty much THE example of Alchemical Exaltation in the Modern Age!</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T14:29:58-07:00","id":121209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=120960#post120960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MVt32qoyhi0\" target=\"_blank\">Wow...Pretty much THE example of Alchemical Exaltation in the Modern Age!</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I was hoping for something Lunar when I saw her change through three or four different kind of eyes just by blinking.<br /> <br /> But then she got more &quot;omnipotent&quot; than that Alice woman from the Resident Evil movies, and I doubt that Lunars are going to have time-manipulation shenanigans anymore.<br /> <br /> I wonder if she's not actually more Getimian than Alchemical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T04:36:13-07:00","id":121618,"title":"","content":"It's seem that in Journey to the West, animal can gain sentinel by listening to monk reciting sutra, and then there is that godly familiar charm in Sidereal Ride.<br /> <br /> Those are perfect for me to replicate Shirokuma Cafe, a slice-of-life anime about a very classy cafe shop run by a polar bear that exist only to give everyone in Creation diabetes! Now be amaze by the cuteness!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://24.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_m59cegCTMR1qdc388o1_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"http://i.minus.com/jW4eHRn7Z6Vji.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://i.minus.com/jbfKwjr2gxLVu8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> And the soundtrack make me puke sugar and strawberry syrup parfait.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yCQvZ-xSmJ4\" data-code=\"yCQvZ-xSmJ4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yCQvZ-xSmJ4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T16:29:23-07:00","id":123486,"title":"","content":"I'm currently playing Child of Light, and it is giving me some ideas for Fair Folk stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T07:08:17-07:00","id":123757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=123486#post123486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm currently playing Child of Light, and it is giving me some ideas for Fair Folk stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>So I Google the name and look at some the the screenshots, while the backgrounds are very pretty, children's doodle art direction is not exactly new, but then Amano's painting staring into my soul telling me to buy the game. Too bad I don't have the money for a PS4 :'P<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i4.minus.com/jboCMhUkFp3oWb.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T10:26:54-07:00","id":123851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=121209#post121209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was hoping for something Lunar when I saw her change through three or four different kind of eyes just by blinking.<br /> <br /> But then she got more &quot;omnipotent&quot; than that Alice woman from the Resident Evil movies, and I doubt that Lunars are going to have time-manipulation shenanigans anymore.<br /> <br /> I wonder if she's not actually more Getimian than Alchemical.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be. Seeing all the invisible lines of electronic communication amongst people could be like seeing the strands of Fate connecting everyone to the Loom! <br /> <br /> I say Modern Alchemical because of the way it's implanted inside of her, changing her, and a lot of what she does looks like Mental Attribute Augmentations...<br /> <br /> And now, for Celestial Battle Armor (skip to about 4:15 for the juicy bits):<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6E_lsdOFoMM\" data-code=\"6E_lsdOFoMM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6E_lsdOFoMM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> And Soulsteel Sword Evocations!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ugZ9guPHqS4\" data-code=\"ugZ9guPHqS4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ugZ9guPHqS4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> (Now I think on it, bits of Karas could work equally as well for Demon the Descent...)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T11:41:43-07:00","id":123904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=123757#post123757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So I Google the name and look at some the the screenshots, while the backgrounds are very pretty, children's doodle art direction is not exactly new, but then Amano's painting staring into my soul telling me to buy the game. Too bad I don't have the money for a PS4 :'P</div> </div> </div> </div>It is available in a variety of other platforms, though. I'm playing on the PC, and if you have a PS3, XBOX 360 or Wii U, you can play on those.<br /> <br /> It is more than the art that is giving me ideas, though. The dialogue being full of rhymes, the protagonist's hair giving the impression of being in the water all the time, the story giving my mind associations with legends and fairy tales and reminding me of the movie Pan's Labyrinth, the flight bringing to mind a feel of &quot;2D Nights Into Dreams&quot; and a whole bunch of other little things like that. The game is not all that Exalted's Fair Folk on it's own, but the imagery and characteristics of it play with other things on my head to give me ideas appropriate for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:",