ory/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=127064#post127064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I was more making reference to the hard-light, telekinetic Mind-Hand arm. (which he still has at the end if you notice the two-armed shadow)</div> </div> </div> </div>Why not both?!<br /> <br /> Also, Kim, a million cool points of the Mistress Weatherwax icon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T18:30:24-07:00","id":127143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUUAWh8Vbvo\" data-code=\"bUUAWh8Vbvo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bUUAWh8Vbvo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> alchemical colossus or even petropolis geared for navel combat, you interact with the world mostly through your avatar bodies and can have them pretty much control themselves as you direct them or take direct control","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T14:51:30-07:00","id":130197,"title":"","content":"I just read 'Elric of Melnibone' for the first time. OMG it just screams exalted to me. The decadent empire island, the primitive lands surrounding. Demons, Elementals, and epic sorceries... Oh yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/37-dionysus","name":"Dionysus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar37_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T23:29:41-07:00","id":131732,"title":"","content":"What about the film Red Cliff? That's got a pretty Dragon Blooded war feel to it right there. It's got everything, a massive battle of armies, generals with talents far beyond their men, tactical thinking outside of the box. <br /> <br /> It's basically what I expect a Realm Civil war to look like. I mean yeah there are no people running around on Super Fire or anything but lack of anima aside, it's pretty dang dynastic. And if you watch the extended one (two DVDs about 3 hours each) You get to see ridiculously amazingly put together diplomatic scenes. <br /> <br /> The American version was kinda paired down. They stuck to the action and such. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJHY6jr46A4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJHY6jr46A4\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJHY6jr46A4\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJHY6jr46A4 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> also ... yep Since the changeover from whitewolf this is my first post. So yay that I guess.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T10:09:27-07:00","id":188049,"title":"","content":"There's been a lot of talk about the Underworld and the Labyrinth recently; THIS is what Horror in Exalted should look like!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wd-GUUREFB8\" data-code=\"wd-GUUREFB8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/wd-GUUREFB8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Jeff Bridges makes an awesome Sidereal Sifu!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F4zX--5Ils8\" data-code=\"F4zX--5Ils8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/F4zX--5Ils8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> For some reason, I'm getting strong Infernal vibes from this, rather than Solar...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Uro03xQwrA\" data-code=\"7Uro03xQwrA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/7Uro03xQwrA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> This reminds me of the &quot;graduate your campaign&quot; ad from a while back; the guy showing up the &quot;D&amp;D adventurer&quot; even *looks* like a Solar!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OZXUmTMP4BI\" data-code=\"OZXUmTMP4BI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OZXUmTMP4BI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T12:42:11-07:00","id":206462,"title":"","content":"Two Lunars,a Solar and a pair of Dragon-Blooded taking on a trio of Abyssals, a forest goddess and some sort of aquatic warstrider. Really, how could this <i>not</i> go in this thread?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vzHrjOMfHPY\" data-code=\"vzHrjOMfHPY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vzHrjOMfHPY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2160-elemental","name":"Elemental","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"412"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T07:41:40-07:00","id":208300,"title":"","content":"This has already made it to this forum, but I feel it deserves to be here as well:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eA0JVAeSibc\" data-code=\"eA0JVAeSibc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eA0JVAeSibc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Apparently, this is somewhat based on the Chinese novel The Investiture of the Gods, about which Wikipedia says: &quot;<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuanshi_Tianzun\" target=\"_blank\">Yuanshi Tianzun</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> bestows upon Jiang Ziya the </span></span></span><i>Fengshen Bang</i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, a list that empowers him to invest the gods of Heaven. The heroes of Zhou and some of their fallen enemies from Shang are eventually endowed with heavenly ranking and essentially elevated to their roles as gods, hence the title of the novel.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Sounds like a good description of Exaltation, doesn't it?<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T20:51:46-07:00","id":209001,"title":"","content":"Haven't had any good Lunar MA action here in a while...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rgJ7Yf_2GuI\" data-code=\"rgJ7Yf_2GuI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/rgJ7Yf_2GuI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Just a normal day at the office of the Celestial Bureaucracy!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YCQ4HYIp-eU\" data-code=\"YCQ4HYIp-eU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YCQ4HYIp-eU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Ah, those wacky Lunars...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=piH5_aP0fY8\" data-code=\"piH5_aP0fY8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/piH5_aP0fY8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Who said ancient Sidereals can't change their final fated day to die?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6be0-1-2aCQ\" data-code=\"6be0-1-2aCQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6be0-1-2aCQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T05:35:29-07:00","id":220072,"title":"","content":"Here's a couple I don't recall seeing in the thread earlier. Both are from the same animator and a lot of people are hoping for a crossover between them in the future.<br /> <br /> <i>Rise of the Epic Scout</i> has a great example of what an Exaltation might be like:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XBamIRB91f8\" data-code=\"XBamIRB91f8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/XBamIRB91f8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> And <i>Meet the Rabid Heavy Taming Engineer </i>is a great example of a Solar and Lunar pair:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yeRV8iVWtbY\" data-code=\"yeRV8iVWtbY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yeRV8iVWtbY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1774-shadowfighter88","name":"ShadowFighter88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T15:17:02-07:00","id":220481,"title":"","content":"Behold the storied origins of Sky Breaker Throw.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GOJoLaxokzM\" data-code=\"GOJoLaxokzM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/GOJoLaxokzM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> (This may be the greatest thing I have seen in my life.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T11:37:16-07:00","id":246984,"title":"","content":"So, I dunno if someone else has brought this up yet, but I Recently watched Noah, and it's actually an amazing piece of potential inspiration for Exalted. Anywhere from the brief glimpses of epic battles, strange creatures, the puzzling nature of messages from deities, everything feels like it'd be at home in Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T12:13:32-07:00","id":247028,"title":"","content":"Interesting Alchemical shenanigans:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMo0JMDKjdM\" data-code=\"jMo0JMDKjdM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jMo0JMDKjdM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> This sort of roadwork could only exist in Exalted Modern!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0CfvnIAtK_0\" data-code=\"0CfvnIAtK_0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0CfvnIAtK_0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T12:30:49-07:00","id":247036,"title":"","content":"I'm going to toss out <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/102500/\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Amalur</a> as another videogame that Exalted fans might enjoy. The gameplay can get a bit grind-y, but the core aesthetics of the game resonate a lot with Exalted. You're playing a character that is outside Fate in a world where Fate determines everything for everyone, you possess a unique power to change the world that makes you like unto a god among men, and you spend a lot of time wandering around fighting giant monsters in giant environments with giant weapons. It's also one of the few games I've played that lets you wield a range of daiklave-like weapons without looking completely stupid. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T16:43:05-07:00","id":247247,"title":"","content":"I don't know whether it was already mentioned or not, but Brandon Sanderson's Stormlight Archive novels are Exalted to the core. They have artifact armors and soul-cutting daiklaves that require attunement in order to move around and fight with them, legendary superpowered heroes returning after long absence (reviled very much like the Solar Anathema), a post-post-apocalyptic setting with lots of strange fauna and flora, hearthstone-powered magitech industry, a nation very reminiscent of the Blessed Isle's Dynasts, epic (in the correct sense of the word) narrative with larger than life characters...<br /> They have it all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3751-ferozstein","name":"Ferozstein","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3751_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T18:02:53-07:00","id":247303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=220481#post220481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(This may be the greatest thing I have seen in my life.)</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;So awesome.... So dumb&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1920-kim","name":"Kim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T05:14:37-07:00","id":247751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=247303#post247303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;So awesome.... So dumb&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This isn't quite that over the top, but in terms of sheer ridiculousness...<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_oMtTPxqJRI#t=4m30s\" target=\"_blank\">I think I can top it!</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T08:40:34-07:00","id":251494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.tsi-games.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.tsi-games.com/wp-content/themes/Divi/images/logo.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.tsi-games.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> TSI Games | TSI Games </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.tsi-games.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.tsi-games.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> TSI started out as a dream. A dream many of you seem to share. It&rsquo;s the return of a company you could depend upon to consistently deliver a meaningful RPG experience. While there are many classic RPG franchises and several talented studios, SSI and the Gold Box games delivered, time and again, a new adventure using the same type of compelling, tactical experience. You knew exactly what you were getting: proven technology, a great system/setting, and strategic, party-based combat. Our company, TSI, was formed in that same spirit. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The devs behind the old SSI gold box games (Pool of Radiance et al for those poor bastards who don't know the name, and if you've never played them, your life is incomplete) are working on a new game called Seven Dragon Saga, set in the (funnily enough) named Empire of the Seven Dragons, where you play a group of high powered heroes called Touched.<br /> <br /> Not many details as yet, but I'm very cautiously optimistic, and the setting overview sounds quite Exalted","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/649-nightwinder","name":"Nightwinder","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T13:48:18-07:00","id":251693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=247751#post247751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> This isn't quite that over the top, but in terms of sheer ridiculousness...<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_oMtTPxqJRI#t=4m30s\" target=\"_blank\">I think I can top it!</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Hahaha! This is so an RPGscene, haha!<br /> Love it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1920-kim","name":"Kim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T23:11:41-07:00","id":256540,"title":"","content":"The Chinese release Tv series and Online game adaptions of Jin Yong wuxia novel almost every years, here the trailer for Condor Heroes.<br /> <br /> The first fight is obvious a Solar Hero again an Abyssal, what with the spider-like and unnatural body movement (or maybe he a Liminal). The second I have no idea, what splat in Exalted can shoot laser-whip out of their hands anyway.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JG3TaAlsvgk&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-code=\"JG3TaAlsvgk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JG3TaAlsvgk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T17:34:51-07:00","id":258589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=256540#post256540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The second I have no idea, what splat in Exalted can shoot laser-whip out of their hands anyway.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JG3TaAlsvgk&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-code=\"JG3TaAlsvgk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JG3TaAlsvgk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>DBs did have elemental bolts, you could probably come up with custom charms to make it a whip.<br /> Solars had Glorious Solar Sabre which could replicate any weapon, including laser like whip.<br /> There was also Terrestrial spell that let you make whip from your blood.<br /> Obviously Exigens could have customized attacks that could look like this.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T09:30:11-07:00","id":259015,"title":"","content":"Recently stumbled on this artist (<a href=\"http://blog.sina.com.cn/u/2294356157\" target=\"_blank\">http://blog.sina.com.cn/u/2294356157</a>)<br /> <br /> Can we get him for some 3E art? I think he gets it.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mQCle5N.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> And here's some more...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/BmIUQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/BmIUQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/BmIUQ\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/a/BmIUQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T23:17:53-07:00","id":263488,"title":"","content":"I dunno if anyone has mentioned it yet, but I look at the trailer for Dracula Untold and I think nothing but Dusk Caste.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e1_E84So-2I\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e1_E84So-2I\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e1_E84So-2I\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e1_E84So-2I </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T11:22:57-07:00","id":263994,"title":"","content":"In the middle of reading of Charles Stross' Laundry Files series. Works better for Demon and Mage but does give some fun bureaucracy to throw at Sidereals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","name":"MuscaDomestica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T09:40:15-07:00","id":272973,"title":"","content":"So a Taois Necromancer Abyssal and her Liminal Jiang-shi meet a Ghost-Blooded Solar. Kinda make me wonder what Liminal's Resistance and Brawl charms will look like.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.minus.com/ibdCNaulUBBe1q.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T21:48:44-07:00","id":273487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jorlem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=68262#post68262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The ruined cities described in <a href=\"http://www.fimfiction.net/story/102166/lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\">this fanfic </a>are going to be a major source of inspiration for me for First Age and Shogunate Era ruins, once EX3 hits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just wanted to re-mention this, as it has just updated again after a bit over a year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />If you want to play Thomas Edison, you'd better be up to the task of carrying all of civilization through the Renaissance and Industrial Revolution, <i>while the Sidereals and Dragon-Blooded are shooting at you</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/591-jorlem","name":"Jorlem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar591_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T13:44:51-07:00","id":274147,"title":"","content":"I haven't been able to find it again, but on an Exalted thread somewhere hereabouts someone posted a film clip of a magic battle between a guy telekinetically flinging thousands of blades at another who defended by conjuring a big crystal shield around himself. Does that ring a bell for anyone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T14:39:41-07:00","id":274176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=274147#post274147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't been able to find it again, but on an Exalted thread somewhere hereabouts someone posted a film clip of a magic battle between a guy telekinetically flinging thousands of blades at another who defended by conjuring a big crystal shield around himself. Does that ring a bell for anyone?</div> </div> </div> </div>Animated or live action?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T10:37:13-07:00","id":274838,"title":"","content":"Live action. I had the impression that it was a Chinese fantasy/adventure movie, but couldn't swear to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T11:09:37-07:00","id":274865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=274147#post274147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't been able to find it again, but on an Exalted thread somewhere hereabouts someone posted a film clip of a magic battle between a guy telekinetically flinging thousands of blades at another who defended by conjuring a big crystal shield around himself. Does that ring a bell for anyone?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure it was me posting the intro scene from <i>Storm Warriors:</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0E2xLgZzRkw\" data-code=\"0E2xLgZzRkw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0E2xLgZzRkw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> It's not so much a crystal shield as it is his aura of power. Lord Godless is a very powerful defensive character, so to speak.<br /> <br /> The movie is Korean, and well worth watching as an Exalted inspiration. Sadly, Youtube clips are all of very poor quality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 10-07-2014, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T10:01:13-07:00","id":275523,"title":"","content":"That is indeed the one I was thinking of. Much obliged!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T15:17:25-07:00","id":278419,"title":"","content":"Did someone post GARO?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1472-mostlyjoe","name":"Mostlyjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T20:34:30-07:00","id":278554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=274865#post274865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure it was me posting the intro scene from <i>Storm Warriors:</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0E2xLgZzRkw\" data-code=\"0E2xLgZzRkw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0E2xLgZzRkw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> It's not so much a crystal shield as it is his aura of power. Lord Godless is a very powerful defensive character, so to speak.<br /> <br /> The movie is Korean, and well worth watching as an Exalted inspiration. Sadly, Youtube clips are all of very poor quality.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Storm Warriors is not Korean, it is Chinese. the base language on the bd is cantonese and mandarin. besides it is the sequel to 1998's The Storm Riders, which stars the same actors in the tittle roles. As far as i'm concerned, both films are required viewing for players of Exalted to showcase how combat in this game should be visualized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T20:48:50-07:00","id":278557,"title":"","content":"I am absolutely flabbergasted. I was convinced it was Korean.<br /> <br /> I must have had it confused with some other movie, but I have no idea which. It seemed clear in my mind precisely because &quot;high-special effects Korean martial arts movie&quot; isn't something I see every day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T21:56:32-07:00","id":278583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=278557#post278557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am absolutely flabbergasted. I was convinced it was Korean.<br /> <br /> I must have had it confused with some other movie, but I have no idea which. It seemed clear in my mind precisely because &amp;quot;high-special effects Korean martial arts movie&amp;quot; isn't something I see every day.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe you were getting it mixed up with the legend of the shadowless sword, which IS Korean and flipping awesome. it harkens back to the height of HK wuxia films from the 90's like the swordsman films, fist of legend, drunken master II, Fong Sai Yuk etc, and would rank as high as any film from those days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T23:29:39-07:00","id":278611,"title":"","content":"Thaaaat's the one.<br /> <br /> To which I was first introduced with a clip of that marketplace fight scene presented as an example of how a Wyld Hunt reaching the Solars they were tracking would look like.<br /> <br /> An excelent example, at that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T00:20:03-07:00","id":278649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuSoardGraphite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=278583#post278583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe you were getting it mixed up with the legend of the shadowless sword, which IS Korean and flipping awesome. it harkens back to the height of HK wuxia films from the 90's like the swordsman films, fist of legend, drunken master II, Fong Sai Yuk etc, and would rank as high as any film from those days.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Fuck, surprised to find someone else has seen Shadowless Sword. Quality movie, that. Dunno if I'd put in on par with Fong Sai Yuk or Dance of the Drunken Mantis, but still damned good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T00:32:03-07:00","id":278650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=278649#post278649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Fuck, surprised to find someone else has seen Shadowless Sword. Quality movie, that. Dunno if I'd put in on par with Fong Sai Yuk or Dance of the Drunken Mantis, but still damned good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally i find shadowless sword to be superior to Fong Sai Yuk and approaching Swordsman II in quality but i know that not necessarily going to be a popular opinion amongst wuxia fans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T01:08:30-07:00","id":278664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuSoardGraphite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=278650#post278650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personally i find shadowless sword to be superior to Fong Sai Yuk and approaching Swordsman II in quality but i know that not necessarily going to be a popular opinion amongst wuxia fans.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a damn fine movie, though I'd give the edge to Reign of Assassin's, at lest as far as movies that came out in the same general time frame. Shadowless Sword is still fantastic (And well overdue for a re-watch in my circles)<br /> <br /> Honestly, though, probably my all time favorite wuxia movie is, well, Wuxia, starring Donnie Yen, Takeshi Kaneshiro, and an amazing guest appearance from Jimmy Wang Yu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T14:06:35-07:00","id":279055,"title":"","content":"Rob Liefeld's take on the Old Testament, which I'm sure was what some 2E writers had in mind:<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i21.photobucket.com/albums/b289/Elemental402/testament1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i21.photobucket.com/albums/b289/Elemental402/Test3-1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i21.photobucket.com/albums/b289/Elemental402/Test4-1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcod