eonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-31T06:26:55-07:00","id":298058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://youtu.be/HBUaZ6QbsAM\" data-code=\"HBUaZ6QbsAM\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/HBUaZ6QbsAM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Here is a collection of trailers from the Saint Seiya CG animation. For presentation of powers, it doesn't get more Exalted than Saint Seiya!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T23:26:26-08:00","id":301855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dionysus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=130197#post130197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just read 'Elric of Melnibone' for the first time. OMG it just screams exalted to me. The decadent empire island, the primitive lands surrounding. Demons, Elementals, and epic sorceries... Oh yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Elric is exalted as hell. I havent read it in years. i should get into it again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T11:47:33-08:00","id":302481,"title":"","content":"I can't believe I didn't think of this sooner.<br /> <br /> One computer game that really captures the feel of Exalted, to me, is Divinity II: Ego Draconis (also known as the Dragon Knight Saga). In it, you play an elite soldier, and on your first mission, are unwillingly imbued with the essence and power of your order's sworn enemies; the Dragons. Throughout the game, you have to struggle against both a hostile world, and your own former comrades, who would all see you killed for a crime that was committed before you were born. You are guided by the ghost of the woman whose draconic magic you inherited, on no lesser a quest than to destroy the incarnate god of evil, and redeem the tarnished name of dragonkind.<br /> <br /> In Exalted terms, you are a mortal Wyld Huntsman, who gets the Exaltation of the Lunar your leaders killed, along with the most badass spirit shape ever, and determines to redeem the name of the Celestials, while bringing down the Infernal overlord who turned Creation's defenders against each other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T00:52:59-08:00","id":303085,"title":"","content":"So, yeah. Wakfu season 2 just hit Netflix, so I was finally able to finish it in HD and without fighting with subtitle files. Not going to spoil anything, but holy hell is there some primo Exalted fodder in the run up to, and including, the finale. Even more than season one.<br /> <br /> Also, if you haven't watched it yet, Wakfu is on Netflix. Seriously. Go watch it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://youtu.be/xqnY3CNJdiQ\" data-code=\"xqnY3CNJdiQ\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xqnY3CNJdiQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{