bnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T11:23:10-08:00","id":789330,"title":"","content":"So during a game we got to talking and realized, Dethklok is the best example of abyssal performance. Not only do people just, die during any concert, but knowing this people still go to see them and cheer the entire time. Fans are mutilated by the performers and just become bigger fans<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VFURd_EOIuU\" data-code=\"VFURd_EOIuU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/VFURd_EOIuU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Heck lets remember when they summoned an ancient behemoth<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DkdnyYCXPlA\" data-code=\"DkdnyYCXPlA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DkdnyYCXPlA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> Before you say that is more like demon summoning, they even say &quot;from your book of necromatic spells&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T12:30:37-08:00","id":789364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=789330#post789330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So during a game we got to talking and realized, Dethklok is the best example of abyssal performance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gaming groups in my past have been divided on whether it fit better as Abyssal or Infernal, before coming to the reluctant conclusion of &quot;mixed circle of both.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=789330#post789330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Before you say that is more like demon summoning, they even say &quot;from your book of necromatic spells&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The world of Dethklok doesn't have this rigorous categorization where one set of spells is arbitrarily sorcery and one set of spells is arbitrarily necromancy. There's rather a lot of fiction in which a character who is called a necromancer or is said to practice necromancy does not spend any portion of the fiction divining information by communing with the dead.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T14:10:16-08:00","id":789420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=789364#post789364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gaming groups in my past have been divided on whether it fit better as Abyssal or Infernal, before coming to the reluctant conclusion of &quot;mixed circle of both.&quot;<br /> The world of Dethklok doesn't have this rigorous categorization where one set of spells is arbitrarily sorcery and one set of spells is arbitrarily necromancy. There's rather a lot of fiction in which a character who is called a necromancer or is said to practice necromancy does not spend any portion of the fiction divining information by communing with the dead.</div> </div> </div> </div>but in exalted we do have an example of someone raising a defeated behemoth, and that was done with necromancy.<br /> <br /> Just the exalted community tends to warp and twist pretty much everything to be infernal as mary-sues tend to do. I would at the very least give &quot;people die from simply being around you, in mass when playing music&quot; as good examples of resonance and abyssal performance charms respectively since this is pretty much what they are designed to do. Including giving the band members nihilistic apathy. Infernals on the other hand are about intentional cruelty and corruption. <br /> <br /> Infernals ape the themes and concepts of all other splats, with examples of death, shapeshifting, fate altering, excellency, even flavors of the elements. They'd be easy to spin just about anything as infernal so if anything it should be the last thing you jump to as an analogy.<br /> <br /> Sorry thats kind of aggressive and ranty but &quot;everything is infernals&quot; has become a pet peeve of mine. An example of &quot;ruined by the fandom&quot; for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T14:42:25-08:00","id":789433,"title":"","content":"I realized this when the series in question came up in a conversation, but the Crimson Denizens of Shakugan No Shana are pretty great inspiration for Yozi and Demons. Right down to the titles.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T00:24:47-08:00","id":790739,"title":"","content":"So a while back I posted a pair of Source Filmmaker videos from someone by the name of Crash Maul - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XBamIRB91f8\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Epic Scout</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yeRV8iVWtbY\" target=\"_blank\">Meet the Rabid Heavy Taming Engineer</a>.<br /> <br /> Earlier today... Crash Maul released a crossover.<br /> <u><b>The Fight for Sawmill</b></u><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=60zJjHAjG3E\" data-code=\"60zJjHAjG3E\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/60zJjHAjG3E/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1774-shadowfighter88","name":"ShadowFighter88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T00:52:25-08:00","id":791409,"title":"","content":"That was fantastic, ShadowFighter. My thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T00:58:08-08:00","id":791413,"title":"","content":"So, what I saw was a Modern Age Sidereal fighting against a Solar and his chimera Lunar mate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T01:12:04-08:00","id":791420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khantalas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=791413#post791413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what I saw was a Modern Age Sidereal fighting against a Solar and his chimera Lunar mate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would go with a Dodge-specced Abyssal fighting Creation's most esoteric Dragon-Blooded (Celestial-level Martial Arts and Sorcery, but very few native Charms) who was backed by his Sorcerous construct. But, you know, there's options.<br /> <br /> I might even wind up switching over to agree with you on the Sidereal front - those injuries certainly told a lot harder against the Scout than the Engineer.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T01:51:39-08:00","id":791431,"title":"","content":"The Mark of Kri just got an &quot;upscaled&quot; re-release on the PS4.<br /> <br /> Amazing styling inspired heavily by Polynesian culture and art, designed by former Disney animators. Power-level wise, probably more of a heroic mortal/terrestrial level, but still amazing setting and mythos.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://farm6.staticflickr.com/5494/9826623603_cc0b7182d8_z.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2cJOZ6h4jcc\" data-code=\"2cJOZ6h4jcc\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/2cJOZ6h4jcc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T02:39:22-08:00","id":791444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=791409#post791409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That was fantastic, ShadowFighter. My thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khantalas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=791413#post791413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what I saw was a Modern Age Sidereal fighting against a Solar and his chimera Lunar mate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I wasn't sure how to describe it so I left it open.<br /> <br /> On another matter; the moment the Abbots turn up here seems like a very &quot;Suddenly: Sidereals&quot; moment.<br /> <br /> <b>WARNING - SPOILERS FOR <i>INTO THE BADLANDS</i> SEASON FINALE</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZdcNK2yAppI\" data-code=\"ZdcNK2yAppI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ZdcNK2yAppI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1774-shadowfighter88","name":"ShadowFighter88","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T20:48:43-08:00","id":791946,"title":"","content":"Versus <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaTBressHfg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaTBressHfg</a><br /> A gang in-fighting in a Shadowland. If it were Exalted, I'd have it be one that they accidentally created, but instead this is an old one, at least 500 years old. Most of the action still heroic mortal level, but it ramps up to Exalted by the end.<br /> <br /> Aragami <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MqcUjJrtTOk\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MqcUjJrtTOk</a><br /> A heroic mortal is faced with a Solar who has a simple request: Do anything you can to try and kill me.<br /> <br /> Volcano High <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V5W351aUYJM\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V5W351aUYJM</a><br /> Almost certainly a highschool somewhere in Creation. Mostly Dragon Blooded in power. Main plot revolves around various factions trying to get access to a training manual... and honestly, the plot is pretty thin. Visually interesting and good stunt fodder though.<br /> <br /> Death Trance <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yXBclL5nWX8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yXBclL5nWX8</a><br /> Main character is probably an Abyssal trekking through a Shadowland or Wyld zone to... well, maybe revive a forbidden god? Not a lot of explanations in this one, but lots of inspiration for cool scenes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2586-beowulf89","name":"Beowulf89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T17:54:52-08:00","id":813779,"title":"","content":"The Deathknight theme song:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fwUAqzlc74s\" data-code=\"fwUAqzlc74s\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/fwUAqzlc74s/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377