 shit in their face, well, I hope you realize you're not doing yourself any favors.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. No one 'accused' you of brain damage. If you took the phrase 'misfiring in your brain' to imply some sort of accusation then... don't do that. It was used in the same way that some people say they 'had a brain fart' or other colloquialisms meant to acknowledge a failure to understand. Its usually much friendlier than interpreting someone's aggressive actions as a deliberate choice to behave like an utter dick. But as you've taken such umbrage at my use of the phrase, I retract it entirely and from now on I will treat you instead as though you have consciously chosen to behave like an utter dick. In doing so, I too am choosing to behave like an utter dick. I must say, it's not a lot of fun. I don't know why you would choose to do it unprovoked.<br /> 2. If you're not 'determined to fight' then you're choosing to make some very aggressive posts, and being very defensive in response. Which seems appropriate in the context of one who has chosen to behave like an utter dick. So... carry on, I guess.<br /> 3. I didn't 'dig this up' in order to 'fling shit in your face' - I went looking for other references to Exalted movies and stories (given the nature of the other thread in which you chose to act like an utter dick, this shouldn't seem that unexpected. My post above wasn't meant to be hostile, more of a jibe, but that depends a lot on interpretation of which I should have been more aware. My mistake was assuming you to be a more forgiving and friendly person than it appears you are (I had not, until this moment, considered that you were actually choosing to be an utter dick. Had I have known that, I would not have bothered to reply to your post at all).<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'm gong to stop being a dick now, because I really don't enjoy it. I invite you to do the same. If you choose to reject my invitation, then please don't bother replying, just go and be a dick somewhere else, because I'd rather get back to talking about the game than dealing with dickishness on my part or yours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":8520,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","user":"CapitanTypo","date":". 02-20-2017, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-20T16:14:32-08:00","id":1052251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CapitanTypo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/61406-exalted-media?p=1052134#post1052134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but it's not *exactly* Exalted, is it? The animal warriors don't band into tribes in the fringes of the world or hunt and kill other animals to take their forms so it's not really appropriate to draw links to exalted all the time. Don't you think?</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Okay, whoever started what in the other thread you don't bring that into this one. </span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https: